From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 04:00:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(mining): reconcile completed and creative block breaks

Send MineBlock requests or legacy destroy transactions in PLAYER_AUTH_INPUT at the break tick, including the matching input flags. Predict damage for tagged vanilla tools and accept authoritative durability only for the same held stack. Handle creative start actions and suppress redundant mining swings; server correction remains authoritative for instant breaks.

Route creative breaks through Bedrock player actions while keeping survival completed-break inventory actions in the server-authoritative request. These paths share the block-breaking transaction and should be reviewed together.
